# The prelude is the automatically visible part of the standard library.
#
# Keep this file declarative: each bare `using` names a sibling stdlib source
# file. The toolchain expands these imports in order when it builds or loads
# the prelude. Libraries absent from this list (for example FS and Regex) stay
# available through an explicit `using`.

